PPT Master skill

Install:
  Install the missing PPT Master skill, system tools and Python environment; repair incomplete Python dependencies.

Upgrade:
  Update the installed PPT Master skill and system tools; rebuild its Python environment.

Status:
  Report local skill files, system package versions and core Python imports.

Requirements:
  Ubuntu, APT and a regular user with sudo access.

Configuration:
  Source: https://github.com/hugohe3/ppt-master
  Destination: ~/.agents/skills/ppt-master
  On upgrade, an existing copy at $CODEX_HOME/skills/ppt-master becomes a link to this directory.
  CODEX_HOME defaults to ~/.codex.
  Python 3.12 environment: .venv inside the installed skill directory.
  Run .venv/bin/python from the skill directory; the installed SKILL.md documents its use.
  LibreOffice uses the same APT package as the libreoffice application module.
  External image-generation services require user-provided credentials.
  First skill backup: ${XDG_STATE_HOME:-$HOME/.local/state}/wsley/backups/.
